ration <code>ablation_k7_contiguous_frame1940</code>.</li> </ul>"},{"location":"experiments/ablation_k_contiguous/#results-summary_9","title":"Results Summary","text":"<ul> <li>Reconstructed Points: 89,662</li> <li>Bounding Box X: -2.9433 to 3.0943</li> </ul>"},{"location":"experiments/ablation_k_contiguous/#ablation_k7_contiguous_frame1980","title":"ablation_k7_contiguous_frame1980","text":"<ul> <li>Path: <code>cow-2026-07-29/ablation_k7_contiguous_frame1980</code></li> <li>Objective: Test performance for configuration <code>ablation_k7_contiguous_frame1980</code>.</li> </ul>"},{"location":"experiments/ablation_k_contiguous/#results-summary_10","title":"Results Summary","text":"<ul> <li>Reconstructed Points: 129,024</li> <li>Bounding Box X: -2.7637 to 2.8681</li> </ul>"},{"location":"experiments/ablation_k_contiguous/#ablation_k7_contiguous_frame200","title":"ablation_k7_contiguous_frame200","text":"<ul> <li>Path: <code>cow-2026-07-29/ablation_k7_contiguous_frame200</code></li> <li>Objective: Test performance for configuration <code>ablation_k7_contiguous_frame200</code>.</li> </ul>"},{"location":"experiments/ablation_k_contiguous/#results-summary_11","title":"Results Summary","text":"<ul> <li>Reconstructed Points: 271,173</li> <li>Bounding Box X: -2.9039 to 2.8247</li> </ul>"},{"location":"experiments/ablation_k_contiguous/#ablation_k9_contiguous_frame125","title":"ablation_k9_contiguous_frame125","text":"<ul> <li>Path: <code>cow-2026-07-29/ablation_k9_contiguous_frame125</code></li> <li>Objective: Test performance for configuration <code>ablation_k9_contiguous_frame125</code>.</li> </ul>"},{"location":"experiments/ablation_k_contiguous/#results-summary_12","title":"Results Summary","text":"<ul> <li>Reconstructed Points: 268,368</li> <li>Bounding Box X: -3.1196 to 2.7995</li> </ul>"},{"location":"experiments/ablation_k_contiguous/#ablation_k9_contiguous_frame1940","title":"ablation_k9_contiguous_frame1940","text":"<ul> <li>Path: <code>cow-2026-07-29/ablation_k9_contiguous_frame1940</code></li> <li>Objective: Test performance for configuration <code>ablation_k9_contiguous_frame1940</code>.</li> </ul>"},{"location":"experiments/ablation_k_contiguous/#results-summary_13","title":"Results Summary","text":"<ul> <li>Reconstructed Points: 106,390</li> <li>Bounding Box X: -3.2335 to 2.9656</li> </ul>"},{"location":"experiments/ablation_k_contiguous/#ablation_k9_contiguous_frame1980","title":"ablation_k9_contiguous_frame1980","text":"<ul> <li>Path: <code>cow-2026-07-29/ablation_k9_contiguous_frame1980</code></li> <li>Objective: Test performance for configuration <code>ablation_k9_contiguous_frame1980</code>.</li> </ul>"},{"location":"experiments/ablation_k_contiguous/#results-summary_14","title":"Results Summary","text":"<ul> <li>Reconstructed Points: 163,967</li> <li>Bounding Box X: -2.7742 to 2.8486</li> </ul>"},{"location":"experiments/ablation_k_contiguous/#ablation_k9_contiguous_frame200","title":"ablation_k9_contiguous_frame200","text":"<ul> <li>Path: <code>cow-2026-07-29/ablation_k9_contiguous_frame200</code></li> <li>Objective: Test performance for configuration <code>ablation_k9_contiguous_frame200</code>.</li> </ul>"},{"location":"experiments/ablation_k_contiguous/#results-summary_15","title":"Results Summary","text":"<ul> <li>Reconstructed Points: 269,149</li> <li>Bounding Box X: -3.4772 to 2.9655</li> </ul>"},{"location":"experiments/ablation_k_uniform/","title":"Ablation: K Uniform","text":"<p>This section documents the ablation studies for this group.</p>"},{"location":"experiments/ablation_k_uniform/#overall-results-plot","title":"Overall Results Plot","text":""},{"location":"experiments/ablation_k_uniform/#ablation_k3_uniform_frame125","title":"ablation_k3_uniform_frame125","text":"<ul> <li>Path: <code>cow-2026-07-29/ablation_k3_uniform_frame125</code></li> <li>Objective: Test performance for configuration <code>ablation_k3_uniform_frame125</code>.</li> </ul>"},{"location":"experiments/ablation_k_uniform/#results-summ